    "notice": "ERC-6900 ERC-4337 validation facet: the EntryPoint's `validateUserOp` entrypoint, routing to the validation module named by the userOp signature prefix. Part of the ERC-6900 account blueprint (an alternative to the ERC-7579 `ERC4337Validation` facet); the two are never cut into the same account. Shares the EntryPoint configured via `ERC4337ValidationLib`.",
